      "Nacy Panzica, Class of 2013"
    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Nacy Panzica spent more than 60 years in construction, guiding Panzica Construction Company from residential remodeling into a major Cleveland-area builder known for craftsmanship and complex projects. His civic service included work with Catholic Charities, Cuyahoga Community College, St. Augustine Manor, health-related charities, and organizations serving people with disabilities."
    ]
